{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WeBowling?! is built from the ground up for Speedrunners. In this game you take control of a bowling ball of your choosing and make your way through the obstacles in the fastest amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the 5 current levels (more to come) contains its own steam leaderboard so you have 5 chances to get the WR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With force sensitivity options and ball selection, you have all the means necessary to tailor the game to your exact specifications!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obstacles range from mini-golf esque obstacles like windmills and spinners to more mundane ones like.... a rock!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to bowl a strike?? Let's find out....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I only have one question for you....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We Bowling?!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564260?t=1741298212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564260/37d660b3e60f01a6d9fab3d815b7c4f51c31a9a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741298212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564260/904d6afccc2b3304c17099cd2e50a7bc76b4e9f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741298212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564260/904d6afccc2b3304c17099cd2e50a7bc76b4e9f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741298212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WeBowling?! is built from the ground up for Speedrunners. In this game you take control of a bowling ball of your choosing and make your way through the obstacles in the fastest amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the 5 current levels (more to come) contains its own steam leaderboard so you have 5 chances to get the WR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With force sensitivity options and ball selection, you have all the means necessary to tailor the game to your exact specifications!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obstacles range from mini-golf esque obstacles like windmills and spinners to more mundane ones like.... a rock!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to bowl a strike?? Let's find out....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I only have one question for you....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We Bowling?!\u00a0</p>","developers":["Edward Powell","Wondering Fox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564260/5ceec899e088ed2998eb40c3ecc4170e709bad00/header.jpg?t=1741298212","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108173,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108173/movie480.mp4?t=1741298209","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108173/movie_max.mp4?t=1741298209"},"name":"GameplaySneakPeak","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108173/1d3e0a427dffffff2a58c587211aae0983bb2cd8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741298209","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108